        "DIFFUSEDFRAMES | USD POSE BRIDGE - OPTIONAL SDXL SHOWCASE\n\nCase A: /World/Camera_A/Camera_A, USD time code 7; 1024 x 768.\nThe colored control is projected from the animated USD rig, not estimated from the photo.\n\nSETUP\n1. Install the USD Pose Bridge pack.\n2. Obtain the separately licensed showcase source assets as described in examples/showcase.\n3. Copy plate_*.png and mask_*.png to ComfyUI/input/diffusedframes_showcase/.\n4. Select an SDXL checkpoint and a matching SDXL OpenPose ControlNet in the two loaders.\n\nRecorded checkpoint: Juggernaut-XL_v9_RunDiffusionPhoto_v2.safetensors\nRecorded ControlNet: SDXL\\xinsir-openpose-sdxl-1.0.safetensors\n\nRun saves the projected pose, OpenPose JSON, feathered edit mask and final composite.\nOnly the feathered edit region is replaced; original background pixels outside it are preserved.\nChange the USD frame or authored camera and regenerate the matching plate/mask for a new case.\nThis is a still-image example; independent SDXL frames do not guarantee temporal consistency.\nNo model download is required to use the pack's pose-export nodes."
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#152536"
    }
